{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/0534fbc3762a75ab7233cb30490118b2.poster.avif?t=1756656836\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/0534fbc3762a75ab7233cb30490118b2.webm?t=1756656836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/0534fbc3762a75ab7233cb30490118b2.mp4?t=1756656836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dystopia Derby</strong></i> is a high-speed grappling hook racing game where you can play your own way. Build your own movement system to discover game-breaking combos, then master your loadout to race at breakneck speed - the speed limit is your skill limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/ee32960a2f83a8b40c3e68d3ab0eae88.poster.avif?t=1756656836\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/ee32960a2f83a8b40c3e68d3ab0eae88.webm?t=1756656836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/ee32960a2f83a8b40c3e68d3ab0eae88.mp4?t=1756656836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergize various unlockable movement abilities to reach Mach speed, and master each of the handcrafted levels to create new shortcuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the 5-part story mode campaign, or race through each level back-to-back in arcade mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 5 interconnected hub worlds to experiment different builds and train</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go solo or compete with your friends online to prove who has the better ball build</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/d20212a8b0a1bc68645671d923d5902f.poster.avif?t=1756656836\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/d20212a8b0a1bc68645671d923d5902f.webm?t=1756656836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/d20212a8b0a1bc68645671d923d5902f.mp4?t=1756656836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BALL BUILDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 12 different unlockable vehicles and 200  builds, there is a movement style for everyone. Ricochet, dash, soar, and self-denotate your way to the finish line to get a new personal best, then mix it up with a different combo. You'll always have room to improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/3c6be65318b7e29736755b9074713aa1.poster.avif?t=1756656836\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/3c6be65318b7e29736755b9074713aa1.webm?t=1756656836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/3c6be65318b7e29736755b9074713aa1.mp4?t=1756656836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.aka